# BAD-NEXT: {{^}}msil-ld: error: managed call '<castclass>' has invalid "msil-managed-*" attributes: "msil-managed-decl" belongs only to a static method or to an instance method whose 'this' conversion is 'this-val' or 'this-gch'{{$}}

